0 367 326 [
[(The "Units per pixel" in this case)]
[(depends on the ratio of the size of)]
[(the graph and its range values. in)]
[(This case, the range for both X and Y)]
[(is from 0 to 300 and the X and Y size)]
[(is also 300, so the unit per pixel is)]
[("1" for both X and Y.)]
